@startuml use_case_diagram

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor User

rectangle "GitHub Workflow Manager" {

  package "Interactive Mode" {
    usecase "Launch interactive menu"  as UI

    usecase "Add workflow run"         as I_ADD
    usecase "List all runs"            as I_LIST
    usecase "Get run detail"           as I_DETAIL
    usecase "Filter runs"              as I_FILTER
    usecase "Exit application"         as I_EXIT

    usecase "Filter by branch"         as I_FBRANCH
    usecase "Filter by status"         as I_FSTATUS
    usecase "Filter by conclusion"     as I_FCONCL
  }

  package "Command-line Mode" {
    usecase "Run one-shot CLI command" as CLI

    usecase "Add workflow run"         as C_ADD
    usecase "List runs"                as C_LIST
    usecase "Get run detail"           as C_DETAIL

    usecase "Filter by branch"         as C_FBRANCH
    usecase "Filter by status"         as C_FSTATUS
    usecase "Filter by conclusion"     as C_FCONCL
  }
}

User --> UI
User --> CLI

UI -[hidden]right-> I_ADD
UI -[hidden]right-> I_LIST
UI -[hidden]right-> I_DETAIL
UI -[hidden]right-> I_FILTER
UI -[hidden]right-> I_EXIT

I_FILTER -[hidden]right-> I_FBRANCH
I_FILTER -[hidden]right-> I_FSTATUS
I_FILTER -[hidden]right-> I_FCONCL

CLI -[hidden]right-> C_ADD
CLI -[hidden]right-> C_LIST
CLI -[hidden]right-> C_DETAIL

C_LIST -[hidden]right-> C_FBRANCH
C_LIST -[hidden]right-> C_FSTATUS
C_LIST -[hidden]right-> C_FCONCL

' Interactive mode actions
UI --> I_ADD
UI --> I_LIST
UI --> I_DETAIL
UI --> I_FILTER
UI --> I_EXIT

I_FBRANCH ..> I_FILTER : <<extend>>
I_FSTATUS ..> I_FILTER : <<extend>>
I_FCONCL  ..> I_FILTER : <<extend>>

CLI --> C_ADD
CLI --> C_LIST
CLI --> C_DETAIL

C_FBRANCH ..> C_LIST : <<extend>>
C_FSTATUS ..> C_LIST : <<extend>>
C_FCONCL  ..> C_LIST : <<extend>>

@enduml